================================================================================================
(1)  THE FILTERED OPERATOR IS NOT HERMITIAN, AND ONLY LOWERS ENERGY
================================================================================================
  ||K - K^dag||_F / ||K||_F      : 1.3981
  ||A - A^dag||_F                : 0.00e+00  (the unfiltered coupling IS Hermitian)
  max |K_ij| lowering (lam_i<lam_j): 1.6558
  max |K_ij| raising  (lam_i>lam_j): 3.88e-03   (suppressed by the filter)

  A non-Hermitian generator is OUTSIDE the class Prop. twoconditions
  describes. The filter does not satisfy the conditions - it leaves them.

